\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\title{Reward semantics and environment coupling}
\tag{ftip}
\p{The same response can be scored by several channels while the environment
can assign different transitions or hidden consequences. A score, a state
transition, and a hidden consequence are distinct functions of the interaction.}
